    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Command a Construct Guardian</p></blockquote><p>A Battle Smith combines protector and medic, an expert at defending others and repairing both gear and people, accompanied by a Steel Defender of their own creation.</p><h3>Battle Smith Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.labZWGSKjD4zZtEa]{Tools of the Trade}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.HxEjpvcv0SeNrXI4]{Battle Ready}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Uerq9IrAioZP5Tl0]{Steel Defender}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.foxsusEMhAwtubBr]{Extra Attack}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.xBd0uxQIIVHZWlxw]{Arcane Jolt}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.Cbbe4C6pz0WhSMXT]{Improved Defender}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Battle Smith Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Artificer Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHeroism000]{Heroism}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShield0000]{Shield}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShiningSmi]{Shining Smite}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWardingBon]{Warding Bond}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.ap9j32ixgVwRkURC]{Aura of Vitality}, @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.moNF3ZiGGKU264lO]{Conjure Barrage}</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.gvBaLNakzHXPur9F]{Aura of Purity}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFireShield]{Fire Shield}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.VtfkGJ41XMGE8iWF]{Banishing Smite}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMassCureWo]{Mass Cure Wounds}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
